      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No.4 Balrath Wood, a 2 bedroom ground floor apartment, c.65 sq.m. Accommodation includes entrance hall, Kitchen/living area, 2 Bedrooms, 1 ensuite and bathroom. The property would make an ideal investment opportunity or indeed a nice property for someone looking for town living in a convenient location. Situated just off the Mullingar Road (N52) within walking distance of Kells town centre. Kells Tennis Club and local GAA grounds are situated nearby together with shops and restaurants. Access to the M3 motorway is within minutes from the property.\nManagement Fee 2025 - 1,885 per annum with early payment at 1,685.\n\nKitchen/living area - 4.08m (13'5) x 4.92m (16'2)\nTo front. Laminate flooring. Fitted kitchen.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.45m (8'0) x 3.4m (11'2)\nTo rear. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite\nWc whb\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.81m (12'6) x 3.67m (12'0)\nTo rear. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.72m (8'11) x 1.81m (5'11)\nTo side. Wc, whb bath with shower attachment.\n\n\nDirections\nFrom Kells turn right onto the Mullingar N52 Road. Balrath Wood Apartments are on the right hand side. \nSee sign.\n\nwhat3words /// chestnut.skippers.honest\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
